      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5980059a0f0b831904883973|full_name}: But mac/PC/Linux asset bundles are cross platform right? If so, supporting Vulkan in your world/avatar in this possible context would mean you support more platforms than just an alternate option on windows if those clients existed. Right?",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
