      "statusChangeID": "5da8d239ad1ad20ac7ba5623",
      "statusChangeNewStatus": "closed",
      "value": "As the person who opened this post, I'm going to close it. I didn't really know enough when I made this post (damn you, Dunning-Kruger). I no longer think swapping to Vulkan is a good idea.\n\nUsing Vulkan would offer very few benefits for a huge amount of work, including (but not limited to) the requirement of re-uploading every single bit of content that has ever existed on VRChat.",
